description.narrative:
The contribution is expected to contribute at the reduction of gender based-violence, hate crime and human trafficking in the eastern region of Moldova, called left bank of Nistru river and Transnistrian region.

The objectives to be supported in 2022-2026 are the following:
- Increase internal effectiveness and sustainability of Women's Initiatives;
- Increase protection of rights holders (victims of domestic violence and victims of trafficking) and refugees;
- Reduce the level of tolerance of society to negative stereotypes associated with domestic violence and human trafficking among men and women, boys and girls, and duty-bearers.
